{
  "Uuid": "18ef9079-a008-429f-b8b8-2657defea6fe",
  "IsCustomNode": false,
  "Description": "On run a file window opens: select the QGIS GeoTIFF (.tif); position and size are read from it, then the Revit image is resized the Revit raster image and places its top-left corner there using shared coordinates (ITM). Open the Site plan (or select the image), Create=True, Run.",
  "Name": "R19 - Place_Aerial_Image_SharedCoords_V11",
  "ElementResolver": {
