        "DescriptionText": "NOTE: When you run, a question window asks if the TIF is from QGIS (Yes continues), then a file window opens - select the GeoTIFF exported from QGIS (right-click aerial layer > Export > Save As > GeoTIFF, CRS EPSG:2157, resolution 0.5, Create VRT OFF). The window may appear behind Revit - check the taskbar. The start folder is just where the window opens. The Revit image is found by the tif file name. Create = False is a dry run.",
